WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.901 --> 00:00:02.300
-Welcome back, everybody.

00:00:02.300 --> 00:00:04.033
I'm here with Tariq Trotter
from the Roots right there.

00:00:04.033 --> 00:00:06.167
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:00:06.167 --> 00:00:08.834
We're about to play a game
called Flip Shots.

00:00:08.834 --> 00:00:10.033
Here we go.

00:00:10.033 --> 00:00:12.067
-♪ Flip shots, shots,
shots, shots ♪

00:00:12.067 --> 00:00:13.267
♪ Flip shots ♪

00:00:13.267 --> 00:00:14.801
-And seeing as both

00:00:14.801 --> 00:00:17.234
of our guests are here
to promote their own drinks,

00:00:17.234 --> 00:00:19.133
I thought this game
was a perfect fit.

00:00:19.133 --> 00:00:23.067
First up, her Prosecco line
Viarae is available now.

00:00:23.067 --> 00:00:25.234
Please welcome Issa Rae.

00:00:25.234 --> 00:00:32.100
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:00:32.100 --> 00:00:33.467
You ready?
-I'm so ready.

00:00:33.467 --> 00:00:35.767
-Are you ready for this?
Ready for this?

00:00:38.467 --> 00:00:43.133
And she is the creative director
of martinis for Grey Goose.

00:00:43.133 --> 00:00:45.400
Give it up for Paris Hilton!

00:00:45.400 --> 00:00:50.601
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:00:50.601 --> 00:00:53.334
-Good to see you.
-Hello.

00:00:53.334 --> 00:00:55.501
-Nice to see you, my friend.

00:00:55.501 --> 00:00:57.334
Alright, here's how it works.

00:00:57.334 --> 00:00:59.934
When I say go, we're all going
to start flipping cups. Okay?

00:00:59.934 --> 00:01:02.334
Like this. And --
Ooh, perfect.

00:01:02.334 --> 00:01:05.100
If your cup lands upright
just like that,

00:01:05.100 --> 00:01:07.501
you move the shot
one square forward

00:01:07.501 --> 00:01:09.300
towards the person
across from you.

00:01:09.300 --> 00:01:12.300
You keep going until the shot
glass crosses the red line.

00:01:12.300 --> 00:01:15.434
If it lands on your side,
you have to do a shot.

00:01:15.434 --> 00:01:17.100
You can choose from one of
the following --

00:01:17.100 --> 00:01:18.501
liquid popcorn butter,

00:01:18.501 --> 00:01:21.667
maple syrup,
or hot dog water.

00:01:21.667 --> 00:01:23.601
-What?
-Yeah.

00:01:23.601 --> 00:01:26.434
-We're going
to play three rounds.

00:01:26.434 --> 00:01:28.033
I'm not going to lose this,
I'll tell you that.

00:01:28.033 --> 00:01:29.934
Alright, when you're ready,
take your position.

00:01:29.934 --> 00:01:31.767
I think I'm here.
-Okay.

00:01:31.767 --> 00:01:33.467
I think I think you're here.

00:01:33.467 --> 00:01:35.968
-Paris is -- Alright, good.
Alright, we can do this.

00:01:35.968 --> 00:01:37.901
I don't want to make,
but we don't want --

00:01:37.901 --> 00:01:39.868
Okay. Whew!

00:01:39.868 --> 00:01:42.634
3, 2, 1. Here we go.

00:01:42.634 --> 00:01:44.634
-Oh, my God. [Bleep]

00:01:44.634 --> 00:01:59.200
♪♪

00:01:59.200 --> 00:02:01.901
-Oh, my gosh!

00:02:01.901 --> 00:02:03.701
Aah!

00:02:03.701 --> 00:02:07.801
♪♪

00:02:07.801 --> 00:02:11.934
-You got it.
-I did?

00:02:11.934 --> 00:02:13.667
[ Buzzer ]

00:02:13.667 --> 00:02:17.434
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:02:17.434 --> 00:02:19.467
What?
-Sorry.

00:02:19.467 --> 00:02:21.067
You have to pick one of these.

00:02:23.200 --> 00:02:26.234
You had to pick one
of these to do a shooter.

00:02:26.234 --> 00:02:27.501
-Do you have any Grey Goose?

00:02:27.501 --> 00:02:28.868
[ Laughter ]

00:02:28.868 --> 00:02:31.133
-We don't have
any Grey Goose out here.

00:02:31.133 --> 00:02:33.267
And there's also a --
there's also a bucket

00:02:33.267 --> 00:02:34.367
if you can't handle
whatever this --

00:02:34.367 --> 00:02:35.667
-My God.

00:02:35.667 --> 00:02:37.601
-You got to go hot dog water.
-I will literally heave.

00:02:37.601 --> 00:02:39.234
Like, I can't even
look at that.

00:02:39.234 --> 00:02:41.534
-I know, I can't even look
at any of them.

00:02:41.534 --> 00:02:43.133
-Um...

00:02:43.133 --> 00:02:45.734
Water, butter,
hot dog water,

00:02:45.734 --> 00:02:47.968
maple -- maple syrup I guess
because it's like the sweetest.

00:02:47.968 --> 00:02:49.400
-Yeah, maple syrup. Exactly.

00:02:49.400 --> 00:02:50.300
That's what you got to do.

00:02:50.300 --> 00:02:52.300
♪♪

00:02:52.300 --> 00:02:53.667
Sorry, sorry.

00:02:53.667 --> 00:03:06.000
♪♪

00:03:06.000 --> 00:03:08.734
-I did some of it.
-You did some of it. Okay.

00:03:08.734 --> 00:03:10.000
Some of it counts, alright.

00:03:10.000 --> 00:03:11.234
But it is -- just
so everyone knows --

00:03:11.234 --> 00:03:12.467
it is maple syrup.
-It really is.

00:03:12.467 --> 00:03:14.067
-Okay, good. Yeah. Okay.

00:03:14.067 --> 00:03:15.968
I can't even now look
at the other two.

00:03:15.968 --> 00:03:17.300
Alright, here we go.

00:03:17.300 --> 00:03:18.767
I don't want to just
keep winning

00:03:18.767 --> 00:03:22.167
because I just feel like
I'm doing really well here.

00:03:22.167 --> 00:03:23.968
-Okay. You're talking, man,
so let's go. Let's get it.

00:03:23.968 --> 00:03:25.501
-Yeah. Come on.
Get your heads in the game.

00:03:25.501 --> 00:03:28.234
-Alright. Here we go. That's
round 1. Now come on, Paris.

00:03:28.234 --> 00:03:30.067
3, 2, 1, go.

00:03:30.067 --> 00:03:36.601
♪♪

00:03:36.601 --> 00:03:38.200
-Yes!

00:03:38.200 --> 00:03:43.067
♪♪

00:03:43.067 --> 00:03:44.434
-No!

00:03:44.434 --> 00:03:50.033
♪♪

00:03:50.033 --> 00:03:51.567
-[Bleep]

00:03:51.567 --> 00:03:53.267
-Aah!
-Aah [bleep].

00:03:53.267 --> 00:03:58.100
♪♪

00:03:58.100 --> 00:04:00.133
-That's it.
It's far away from me.

00:04:00.133 --> 00:04:03.834
♪♪

00:04:03.834 --> 00:04:05.100
-Oh [bleep]

00:04:05.100 --> 00:04:09.300
♪♪

00:04:09.300 --> 00:04:11.100
-Oh, yes!

00:04:11.100 --> 00:04:19.734
♪♪

00:04:19.734 --> 00:04:21.534
[ Buzzer ]
Aah!

00:04:21.534 --> 00:04:24.834
♪♪

00:04:24.834 --> 00:04:27.167
Me again?

00:04:27.167 --> 00:04:31.033
-You again.
Liquid popcorn butter

00:04:31.033 --> 00:04:34.434
or hot dog water,
which is water with just a t--

00:04:34.434 --> 00:04:36.968
The New York City hot dog
is just a taste of hot dog.

00:04:36.968 --> 00:04:40.567
-Yeah.

00:04:40.567 --> 00:04:41.901
-You got to go butter.
-Popcorn.

00:04:41.901 --> 00:04:44.868
-You got to go butter.
-Good choice.

00:04:44.868 --> 00:04:49.133
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:04:49.133 --> 00:04:51.534
-Don't look at it. Don't look at
it. Don't look at it.

00:04:51.534 --> 00:04:53.534
Don't smell!

00:04:53.534 --> 00:04:55.200
-Are you trying to give me
a heart attack?

00:04:55.200 --> 00:04:58.834
-Don't smell it.

00:04:58.834 --> 00:05:02.133
-I can't.

00:05:02.133 --> 00:05:03.400
-Can't do it.
-I can't do it.

00:05:03.400 --> 00:05:05.200
-Alright. Put it right there.
-I tried.

00:05:05.200 --> 00:05:07.701
-That's alright. You tried.
You came close on both.

00:05:07.701 --> 00:05:09.000
-Yeah, yeah.
-Maple syrup.

00:05:09.000 --> 00:05:10.300
-Oh, my goodness.
-Did a little bit.

00:05:10.300 --> 00:05:11.534
She did a little bit.
-But this is what

00:05:11.534 --> 00:05:13.100
it comes down to.
-Yeah, that's the one.

00:05:13.100 --> 00:05:14.667
[ Indistinct talking ]

00:05:14.667 --> 00:05:16.400
-This is the Big Apple
right here.

00:05:16.400 --> 00:05:17.901
-I can't even handle this.

00:05:17.901 --> 00:05:21.033
I'm so, so not -- It's going to
be one of you three drinking.

00:05:21.033 --> 00:05:23.667
-No, it has to be you.
-It cannot be me.

00:05:23.667 --> 00:05:26.701
It's not going to be me.
I'm sorry. Paris. Sorry, Issa.

00:05:26.701 --> 00:05:28.501
I'm sorry, Tariq,
but here we go.

00:05:28.501 --> 00:05:29.901
The last round.

00:05:29.901 --> 00:05:31.767
3, 2, 1!

00:05:31.767 --> 00:05:37.567
♪♪

00:05:37.567 --> 00:05:38.968
-Yes.

00:05:38.968 --> 00:05:44.334
♪♪

00:05:44.334 --> 00:05:45.634
Yes! No.

00:05:45.634 --> 00:05:52.901
♪♪

00:05:52.901 --> 00:05:54.400
-Stop winning!
-What the hell?

00:05:54.400 --> 00:05:56.501
♪♪

00:05:56.501 --> 00:05:59.300
Oh [bleep] my God!

00:05:59.300 --> 00:06:03.534
♪♪

00:06:03.534 --> 00:06:04.968
[ Buzzer ]
Aah!

00:06:04.968 --> 00:06:07.968
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:06:07.968 --> 00:06:09.934
-Whoo!

00:06:09.934 --> 00:06:15.100
♪♪

00:06:15.100 --> 00:06:16.367
-Paris.

00:06:16.367 --> 00:06:23.267
♪♪

00:06:23.267 --> 00:06:24.300
I love you.

00:06:24.300 --> 00:06:25.734
-Yes!

00:06:25.734 --> 00:06:29.567
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:06:29.567 --> 00:06:31.834
That was disgusting.

00:06:31.834 --> 00:06:35.868
My thanks to Issa Rae,
Paris Hilton, Tariq Trotter.

00:06:35.868 --> 00:06:37.133
We're talking with Issa
after the break.

00:06:37.133 --> 00:06:38.133
Stick around, everybody.

